SUMMARY:Taste of Crete
LOCATION:Café Q
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avai
 lable\nTime: 5 PM – 9 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/205635\n\nThis October\, Café Q invites members to experience A Tast
 e of Crete\, a limited-time menu inspired by the sun-soaked flavors and vi
 brant culinary traditions of Greece’s largest island.\n\nAvailable exclu
 sively during dinner service\, this thoughtfully curated menu celebrates t
 he fresh\, uncomplicated spirit of Cretan cuisine—think fresh-caught sea
 food\, seasonal vegetables\, fragrant herbs\, local cheeses\, and exceptio
 nal olive oils\, all rooted in the island’s connection to land and sea. 
 Pair your meal with a crisp Greek white and settle in for a taste of the M
 editerranean\, no passport required.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205635
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
