 idance before moving into rotating play and friendly matches across both s
 ports\, guided by the Ballers team. Members will have the opportunity to r
 otate between pickleball and padel courts to experience both racquet sport
 s with pros and members. Post play\, members can stick around to mix\, min
 gle\, and enjoy food and drinks for purchase at the Ballers food trucks an
 d bar. After play\, members are welcome to stick around to mix\, mingle\,
