SUMMARY:Live Music: Bob Richardson 
LOCATION:The Reading Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Available\n
 Event URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/176376\n\nAdored for hi
 s signature style and smile\, Bob Richardson returns to the 'House for ano
 ther spectacular piano and vocal performance live from the Reading Room. R
 ichardson\, a composer\, arranger\, vocalist and former educator will char
 m the audience with requests all night long.\n\n*Please note that this eve
 nt is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus three guests. Seating 
 is first come\, first served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/176376
CATEGORIES:The Arts
