DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avail
 able\nTime: 8 AM – 5 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/eve
 nts/206909\n\nEnter the ticket lottery for an opportunity to indulge in an
  unforgettable weekend of luxury from the Head of the Charles. ‘Quin mem
 bers will be hosted in an elegant two-tiered Directors’ Lounge - the fla
 gship hospitality destination of the event. Located adjacent to Regatta He
 adquarters at the Cambridge Boat Club\, the Directors’ Lounge offers swe
 eping views of the Eliot Bridge the revered final bridge of the race cours
 e.\n\nIn the Directors’ Lounge\, your day will feature a gourmet\, local
 ly sourced breakfast and lunch\, afternoon snacks and tea\, and a complime
 ntary bar serving beer\, wine\, spirits\, and non-alcoholic beverages. Enj
 oy exclusive programming and premium gifting. This is your front row seat 
 to the action\, with comfort\, hospitality\, and access unlike anything el
 se at The Head of the Charles.\n\n*This event is reserved for members only
 \, with tickets offered in pairs at $350 per pair ($175 per person). Ticke
 ts include access to the Director’s Lounge\, as well as food and beverag
 e throughout the experience. This year\, tickets will be allocated throug
 h a lottery. Members interested in attending are invited to enter the lott
 ery for the opportunity to purchase a pair of tickets. By entering the lot
 tery\, members authorize The ’Quin House to charge the payment method on
  file for $350 should they be selected. The lottery will remain open throu
 gh Wednesday\, October 7th\, with selected members being notified on Thurs
 day\, October 8th. \n\nEnter the Lottery for Saturday or Sunday Tickets
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206909
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
END:VEVENT
