 s you to gather in The Muse for a relaxed\, yet refined dinner\, with fell
 ow members at a similar stage of life.\n\nThe evening unfolds over a thoug
 htfully curated dinner\, complemented by subtle conversation prompts desig
 ned to spark connection\, uncover shared interests\, and keep the dialogue
  flowing throughout the evening.\n\nWhether you are newer to The ‘House\
 , or simply looking to broaden your circle\, consider this an invitation t
 o settle in\, share a table\, and get to know fellow members you may not o
 therwise have the chance to meet. Come for dinner\, stay for the conversat
 ion\, and leave with a few new connections—and perhaps a little serendip
 ity.\n\n*Tickets are $100 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for mem
 bers only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to atte
