SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Friday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nStatus: Waitlist 
 Only\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/eve
 nts/202982\n\nSlip into the camouflage of costume for an evening under the
  ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n\nYou're cordially invited to T
 he ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an elegant and entangled ticketed 
 affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, the ‘House will captivate with
  indulgent buffets\, enchanting performances\, and the deceivingly translu
 cent jeweled veil - of the spider’s web.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victim.\n\nI
 n the shadowed corners of the ‘House\, become entangled in buffets of cu
 linary bites\, live-action stations\, passed delicacies\, and venomous coc
 ktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-seek\, spiral the Grand Staircase lur
 ed by live musical performances\, shadowed portraitists\, acrobats\, and o
 ther-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibes take center stage in \n\nBondo�
 �\n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance from \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\nIn the
  spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘House.\n\nCreative black tie\, cocktai
 l attire\, or a cleverly crafted costume is essential.  \n\nTickets are e
 xclusively available for purchase through the Member App & Portal beginnin
 g September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for members and their guests are $295
 * each. To best accommodate members' varying preferences\, we are delight
 ed to extend a limited allocation of up to 3 guest tickets per member for 
 Friday evening's affair.\n\n*Taxes and beverages are not included in the t
 icket price. Beverages will be available for purchase through our masterfu
 l team of mixologists. \n\n______________________________________________
 ________\n\nPlease be aware of these important notices:\n\nCANCELLATION PO
 LICY\n Kindly note that tickets are non-refundable and nontransferable onc
 e assigned.\n\nENTRY\n All Member and guest tickets purchased\, are linked
  to the Member’s profile through the App and Portal and are required for
  verification and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUEST POLICY\n Following the
  regular Member Policy\, Members must arrive and remain with their guest(s
 ) at all times. Guests must be age 21+. We strongly encourage review of th
 e Members’ Policy to ensure that you and your guest(s) are aware of Club
  rules.\n\nVALET SERVICES\n Valet services will be suspended on the evenin
 gs of October 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure rideshare services or p
 ark at the nearest garage in Back Bay. Metered street parking is limited b
 ut also available.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\n Please be aware that we will offer
  a photo opportunity on these evenings\; however\, the regular Photo Polic
 y will otherwise be in effect and enforced. Those who do not comply with t
 he Privacy Agreement will be asked to leave the Clubhouse in keeping with 
 the standards.\n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted professional photograph
 ers and videographers to capture this event. Any photos or videos distribu
 ted through ’Quin public channels will be edited to conceal the identiti
 es of participating Members and their guest(s). Photos or videos that reve
 al Members will only be used in Member communication with the authorizatio
 n of those captured.\n\nQuestions? Please contact us at halloween@thequin.
 com.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/202982
CATEGORIES:Holiday
END:VEVENT
