SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Saturday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nStatus: You are C
 onfirmed\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com
 /events/202989\n\nSlip into the camouflage of costume for an evening under
  the ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n\nYou're cordially invited 
 to The ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an elegant and entangled tick
 eted affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, the ‘House will captivate
  with indulgent buffets\, enchanting performances\, and the deceivingly t
 ranslucent jeweled veil - of the spider’s web.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victi
 m.\n\nIn the shadowed corners of the ‘House\, become entangled in buffet
 s of culinary bites\, live-action stations\, passed delicacies\, and venom
 ous cocktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-seek\, spiral the Grand Stairc
 ase lured by live musical performances\, shadowed portraitists\, acrobats\
 , and other-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibes take center stage in \n\
 nBondo \n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance from \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\
 nIn the spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘House.\n\nCreative black tie\, 
 cocktail attire\, or a cleverly crafted costume is essential.  \n\nTicket
 s are exclusively available for purchase through the Member App & Portal b
 eginning September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for members and their guests a
 re $295* each. To best accommodate members' varying preferences\, we are 
 delighted to extend a limited allocation of up to 1 guest ticket per membe
 r for Saturday evening's affair.\n\n*Taxes and beverages are not included
  in the ticket price. Beverages will be available for purchase through our
  masterful team of mixologists. \n\n_____________________________________
 _________________\n\nPlease be aware of these important notices:\n\nCANCEL
 LATION POLICY\nKindly note that tickets are non-refundable and nontransfer
 able once assigned.\n\nENTRY\nAll Member and guest tickets purchased\, are
  linked to the Member’s profile through the App and Portal and are requi
 red for verification and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUEST POLICY\nFollowi
 ng the regular Member Policy\, Members must arrive and remain with their g
 uest(s) at all times. Guests must be age 21+. We strongly encourage review
  of the Members’ Policy to ensure that you and your guest(s) are aware o
 f Club rules.\n\nVALET SERVICES\nValet services will be suspended on the e
 venings of October 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure rideshare services
  or park at the nearest garage in Back Bay. Metered street parking is limi
 ted but also available.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\nPlease be aware that we will o
 ffer a photo opportunity on these evenings\; however\, the regular Photo P
 olicy will otherwise be in effect and enforced. Those who do not comply wi
 th the Privacy Agreement will be asked to leave the Clubhouse in keeping w
 ith the standards.\n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted professional photog
 raphers and videographers to capture this event. Any photos or videos dist
 ributed through ’Quin public channels will be edited to conceal the iden
 tities of participating Members and their guest(s). Photos or videos that 
 reveal Members will only be used in Member communication with the authoriz
 ation of those captured.\n\nQuestions? Please contact us at halloween@the
 quin.com.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/202989
CATEGORIES:Holiday
END:VEVENT
